    {
      "InformationID": "Info_003_WanderingBard",
      "MonsterID": "WanderingBard",
      "MonsterInformationName": "炎熱與腐化",
      "MonsterInformation": "高溫會讓本就僵硬的關節更加難受，炎熱天氣對殭屍來說簡直是無法言喻的折磨。",
