      "TagID": "Wet"
    },
    {
      "InformationID": "Info_005_Nekomata",
      "MonsterID": "Nekomata",
      "MonsterInformationName": "怕冷體質",
      "MonsterInformation": "喜歡蜷縮在溫暖角落的她，對寒冷的東西有著生理上的排斥，全身毛髮都會豎起。",
