    },
    {
      "InformationID": "Info_4_VampireCount",
      "MonsterID": "VampireCount",
      "MonsterInformationName": "神聖剋星",
      "MonsterInformation": "神聖之力是吸血鬼族最古老的剋星，接觸帶有神聖氣息的物品會讓他感到灼燒般的疼痛。",
      "TagID": "Holy"
    },
    {
      "InformationID": "Info_5_VampireCount",
      "MonsterID": "VampireCount",
      "MonsterInformationName": "大蒜聯想",
      "MonsterInformation": "凡是蔬菜類，在他眼中都與那可憎的大蒜產生聯想，讓他倒盡胃口，敬而遠之。",
      "TagID": "Vegetable"
    },
    {
      "InformationID": "Info_6_VampireCount",
      "MonsterID": "VampireCount",
      "MonsterInformationName": "陽光剋星",
      "MonsterInformation": "陽光是吸血鬼最致命的弱點，帶有太陽屬性的物品對他來說是連碰都不敢碰的禁忌。",
      "TagID": "Sun"
    },
    {
      "InformationID": "Info_1_PiXiu",
      "MonsterID": "PiXiu",
      "MonsterInformationName": "寶石收藏",
      "MonsterInformation": "只進不出的招財神獸對一切珍貴礦石有著本能的吞噬衝動，越稀有越想要。",
